#. comic551 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic551.htm:46
msgctxt "comic551#title.1"
msgid "\"ASK A STUPID QUESTION\""
msgstr ""

#. comic551 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: army.gif
#: kidradd/comic551.htm:83
msgctxt "comic551#p1.1"
msgid "\"Guys, I don't think I need to say anything.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic551 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: army.gif
#: kidradd/comic551.htm:85
msgctxt "comic551#p1.2"
msgid "\"No. We're all in on this together.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic551 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddtablexp.gif, gnarlstand2.gif, kobastand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic551.htm:147
msgctxt "comic551#p2.1"
msgid "But you two... this isn't your battle. And frankly, you're unskilled. You should take this ship and run."
msgstr ""

#. comic551 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddtablexp.gif, gnarlstand2.gif, kobastand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic551.htm:151
msgctxt "comic551#p2.2"
msgid "Hey, wait a minute..."
msgstr ""

#. comic551 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gsigh.gif, kobafidget.gif
#: kidradd/comic551.htm:198
msgctxt "comic551#p3.1"
msgid "How is this <i>not</i> our battle? If Crystal succeeds, our world is screwed, and then where do we go?"
msgstr ""

#. comic551 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gsigh.gif, kobafidget.gif
#: kidradd/comic551.htm:202
msgctxt "comic551#p3.2"
msgid "Not to mention we never get our rematches if you get killed..."
msgstr ""

#. comic551 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarlblink.gif, kobablink.gif, raddtable8.gif
#: kidradd/comic551.htm:250
msgctxt "comic551#p4.1"
msgid "We'll fight. I've improved a little, and K-boy here's improved a lot! He's practically unstoppable!"
msgstr ""

#. comic551 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarlblink.gif, kobablink.gif, raddtable8.gif
#: kidradd/comic551.htm:254
msgctxt "comic551#p4.2"
msgid "Uh, forgive my skepticism, but how is that possible?"
msgstr ""

#. comic551 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ggroup4.gif
#: kidradd/comic551.htm:303
msgctxt "comic551#p5.1"
msgid "Oh, well we figured out that I have two kinds of moves: Ones just for show that never hit, and \"real\" ones that never miss."
msgstr ""

#. comic551 panel p6
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ggroup5.gif
#: kidradd/comic551.htm:353
msgctxt "comic551#p6.1"
msgid "So now I only use the moves that don't miss. Smart, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. comic551 panel p7
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ggroup6.gif
#: kidradd/comic551.htm:405
msgctxt "comic551#p7.1"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#. comic551 panel p8
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic551.htm:452
msgctxt "comic551#p8.1"
msgid "\"Alright, we're all in. I don't know if this is the team the Seer intended to take on Crystal, but win or lose, let's give her lackies hell.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic552 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic552.htm:60
msgctxt "comic552#title.1"
msgid "\"THE BATTLE BEGINS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic552 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic552.htm:103
msgctxt "comic552#p1.1"
msgid "Damn, I'll bet Crystal's already in the Chimera program. I'll try to get ahead and reach her, since I'm the only one who can fly."
msgstr ""

#. comic552 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic552.htm:158
msgctxt "comic552#p2.1"
msgid "Actually, you're not. Little Eliot's got some pretty strong telekinetic powers, so he'll back you up."
msgstr ""

#. comic552 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic552.htm:210
msgctxt "comic552#p3.1"
msgid "As for the rest of us, eh, we'll keep 'em busy. It'll be tough, but I don't think they realize how powerful we are."
msgstr ""

#. comic552 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: amptable.gif
#: kidradd/comic552.htm:265
msgctxt "comic552#p4.1"
msgid "Well Bogey, guess that leaves just you here on the ship with me and Joule, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. comic552 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ampback.gif
#: kidradd/comic552.htm:317
msgctxt "comic552#p5.1"
msgid "Um, hello?"
msgstr ""

#. comic553 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic553.htm:35
msgctxt "comic553#title.1"
msgid "\"BOTTLED UP\""
msgstr ""

#. comic553 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: nurseworry.gif, ib2.gif
#: kidradd/comic553.htm:76
msgctxt "comic553#p1.1"
msgid "We're not gonna be very helpful, are we?"
msgstr ""

#. comic553 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: nurseworry.gif, ib2.gif
#: kidradd/comic553.htm:80
msgctxt "comic553#p1.2"
msgid "Oh, I dunno about that..."
msgstr ""

#. comic553 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibtablep.gif
#: kidradd/comic553.htm:136
msgctxt "comic553#p2.1"
msgid "Amp's been using Eliot and me as walking storehouses for his more dangerous inventions. He figured character inventories were the only truly safe hiding places for 'em."
msgstr ""

#. comic553 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: nursetalk.gif, ibsmug2.gif
#: kidradd/comic553.htm:183
msgctxt "comic553#p3.1"
msgid "Oh. So we have weapons now?"
msgstr ""

#. comic553 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: nursetalk.gif, ibsmug2.gif
#: kidradd/comic553.htm:187
msgctxt "comic553#p3.2"
msgid "Sort of."
msgstr ""

#. comic553 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ibtoast.gif
#: kidradd/comic553.htm:237
msgctxt "comic553#p4.1"
msgid "We're gonna give 'em a li'l taste of toaster power."
msgstr ""

#. comic553 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ibtoast.gif
#: kidradd/comic553.htm:239
msgctxt "comic553#p4.2"
msgid "Oooh..."
msgstr ""

#. comic553 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ibtoast.gif
#: kidradd/comic553.htm:241
msgctxt "comic553#p4.3"
msgid "Hey, still got that letter opener?"
msgstr ""

#. comic554 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic554.htm:58
msgctxt "comic554#title.1"
msgid "\"WE WILL ROCK YOU\""
msgstr ""

#. comic554 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic554.htm:100
msgctxt "comic554#p2.1"
msgid "Y'know buddy, we make a pretty good team. No dumb boss monster is gonna beat us!"
msgstr ""

#. comic554 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic554.htm:152
msgctxt "comic554#p3.1"
msgid "Yeah, especially not with our new \"side effect!\""
msgstr ""

#. comic554 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: ampback.gif
#: kidradd/comic554.htm:205
msgctxt "comic554#p4.1"
msgid "Oh dear, I hope Joule's okay out there... Whatever was she <i>thinking?</i>"
msgstr ""

#. comic554 panel p5
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic554.htm:253
msgctxt "comic554#p5.1"
msgid "\"Then again, maybe she just needed to blow some steam.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic554 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic554.htm:261
msgctxt "comic554#p5.2"
msgid "Stupid Sheena! Stupid Radd! Argh!"
msgstr ""

#. comic555 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic555.htm:60
msgctxt "comic555#title.1"
msgid "\"LOOKS LIKE WE MADE IT?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic555 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic555.htm:103
msgctxt "comic555#p1.1"
msgid "Such crazy odds. A few heroes against thousands of opponents, racing to reach the final boss. Sounds a lot like a video game, heh."
msgstr ""

#. comic555 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: modmod.gif
#: kidradd/comic555.htm:158
msgctxt "comic555#p2.1"
msgid "Eliot, it looks like Dr. Amp needs you more than I do. Go on and help him, I'll be fine."
msgstr ""

#. comic555 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic555.htm:210
msgctxt "comic555#p3.1"
msgid "Huh, what's this? \"Saves you from one attack.\" Thanks El, good luck to you too."
msgstr ""

#. comic555 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: leanboard.gif
#: kidradd/comic555.htm:265
msgctxt "comic555#p4.1"
msgid "It's funny, facing Crystal's army is certainly no walk in the park, but...<br>I really thought we'd have it even tougher. There's not as many bosses out here as I would have expected."
msgstr ""

#. comic555 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic555.htm:318
msgctxt "comic555#p5.1"
msgid "Of course, she logically would have taken the best monsters inside Chimera... Oh, crap."
msgstr ""

#. comic556 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic556.htm:60
msgctxt "comic556#title.1"
msgid "\"THE BATTLE RAGES ON\""
msgstr ""

#. comic556 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic556.htm:103
msgctxt "comic556#p1.1"
msgid "Gah! Why do I always hafta take a beating before doing an \"ultra\" move?"
msgstr ""

#. comic556 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic556.htm:158
msgctxt "comic556#p2.1"
msgid "Pretty Armageddon!"
msgstr ""

#. comic556 panel p2
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#: kidradd/comic556.htm:169
msgctxt "comic556#p2.2"
msgid "See, I only reused this animation once, while a real magical girl show would use it once per episode."
msgstr ""

#. comic556 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic556.htm:210
msgctxt "comic556#p3.1"
msgid "Yay, cooking is so fun!"
msgstr ""

#. comic556 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: slowen.gif
#: kidradd/comic556.htm:263
msgctxt "comic556#p4.1"
msgid "Hope I'm not too late, but... The lack of guards ain't a good sign..."
msgstr ""

#. comic557 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic557.htm:64
msgctxt "comic557#title.1"
msgid "\"DON'T WANT TO REMEMBER\""
msgstr ""

#. comic557 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: victims.gif
#: kidradd/comic557.htm:101
msgctxt "comic557#p1.1"
msgid "\"Chimerization process is go, please hold still Ms. Crystal.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic557 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic557.htm:165
msgctxt "comic557#p2.1"
msgid "It feels like I've waited for this day forever, since the days I languished in my horrid game..."
msgstr ""

#. comic557 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: crystalmad2.gif, ruby.gif, emerald.gif
#: kidradd/comic557.htm:215
msgctxt "comic557#p3.1"
msgid "This guy's picking a fight with us <i>again?</i> He kicked our asses thirty seconds ago!"
msgstr ""

#. comic557 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystalmad2.gif, ruby.gif, emerald.gif
#: kidradd/comic557.htm:219
msgctxt "comic557#p3.2"
msgid "It's called \"leveling up.\" For some reason humans love it."
msgstr ""

#. comic557 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic557.htm:269
msgctxt "comic557#p4.1"
msgid "I know what it's called, but it's not fair! We have absolutely no say in this! We're just playthings for some really messed up humans!"
msgstr ""

#. comic557 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: cheadmad.gif
#: kidradd/comic557.htm:324
msgctxt "comic557#p5.1"
msgid "The utter powerlessness drives me insane! But I won't let this stupid game beat me! If there's any way, any way at all, I'll free myself and <i>never</i> be anyone's puppet again!"
msgstr ""

#. comic558 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic558.htm:34
msgctxt "comic558#title.1"
msgid "\"IN THE REAL WORLD\""
msgstr ""

#. comic558 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: thought2.gif, victims.gif
#: kidradd/comic558.htm:75
msgctxt "comic558#p1.1"
msgid "Stupid GI Guy thought he was such a knight in shining armor for rescuing me. Man, I hated him for it. I should've escaped on my own."
msgstr ""

#. comic558 panel p2
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: crystaltablebd.gif, ruby2.gif, giright.gif, emerald.gif
#: kidradd/comic558.htm:127
msgctxt "comic558#p2.1"
msgid "\"He was a tough guy, almost my equal. ...But such a goody-goody. I felt like I was going to drown in the flood of idealism he spewed.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic558 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: crystaltablebd.gif, ruby2.gif, giright.gif, emerald.gif
#: kidradd/comic558.htm:133
msgctxt "comic558#p2.2"
msgid "Ergh."
msgstr ""

#. comic558 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: crystaltablebd.gif, ruby2.gif, giright.gif, emerald.gif
#: kidradd/comic558.htm:137
msgctxt "comic558#p2.3"
msgid "So are you and Crystal, like?... Heehee!"
msgstr ""

#. comic558 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, waiting.gif
#: kidradd/comic558.htm:185
msgctxt "comic558#p3.1"
msgid "But luckily, at that time they needed someone like me to establish strict regulations over the populace. They didn't want to repeat the mistakes of something called \"Protos,\" which they avoided talking about."
msgstr ""

#. comic558 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, waiting2.gif
#: kidradd/comic558.htm:237
msgctxt "comic558#p4.1"
msgid "GI may have been officially in charge, but I was the one doing the real work to hold that society together, including the necessary shadier dealings. My rise to true power was inevitable."
msgstr ""

#. comic559 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic559.htm:53
msgctxt "comic559#title.1"
msgid "\"REALLY TRULY?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic559 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, waiting2.gif
#: kidradd/comic559.htm:96
msgctxt "comic559#p1.1"
msgid "The fool really thought that somehow he could set up a world where everyone would co-exist, blissful freedom for all. But years of being trapped in my game had taught me the truth:"
msgstr ""

#. comic559 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, cheadblink.gif
#: kidradd/comic559.htm:152
msgctxt "comic559#p2.1"
msgid "There are only two kinds of people in this world, the controllers and the controlled. Freedom can never exist for everybody."
msgstr ""

#. comic559 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic559.htm:205
msgctxt "comic559#p3.1"
msgid "So I kicked that idiot's ass all over the place and locked him up in the RAM Warehouse. Yeah, I know, killing him would've been smarter."
msgstr ""

#. comic559 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, waiting.gif
#: kidradd/comic559.htm:257
msgctxt "comic559#p4.1"
msgid "So why didn't I? I really don't know... I guess maybe I sort of <i>wanted</i> him to come back and challenge me again. Just to show him that I'm still - and will always be - better than him."
msgstr ""

#. comic559 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, waiting3.gif
#: kidradd/comic559.htm:311
msgctxt "comic559#p5.1"
msgid "In the end, there can only be true freedom for one - the one who rules it all. And today, that one shall be me."
msgstr ""

#. comic560 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic560.htm:48
msgctxt "comic560#title.1"
msgid "\"CLEAR AS CRYSTAL\""
msgstr ""

#. comic560 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: csbehind.gif
#: kidradd/comic560.htm:89
msgctxt "comic560#p1.1"
msgid "Uh-oh."
msgstr ""

#. comic560 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: csbehind.gif
#: kidradd/comic560.htm:93
msgctxt "comic560#p1.2"
msgid "Hello Radd. I'm a little surprised you made it here. For that, I offer most sincere congratulations."
msgstr ""

#. comic560 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: chargeb.gif, csleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic560.htm:146
msgctxt "comic560#p2.1"
msgid "My my, how forward of you. I see you want to skip the pleasantries, but I certainly don't."
msgstr ""

#. comic560 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: boardf.gif, csbtable.gif
#: kidradd/comic560.htm:197
msgctxt "comic560#p3.1"
msgid "Hey, talk all you want. Be my guest."
msgstr ""

#. comic560 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: boardf.gif, csbtable.gif
#: kidradd/comic560.htm:201
msgctxt "comic560#p3.2"
msgid "Thus giving you time to power up. Very well, I'll take my chances, because I want to reward your efforts with a little bit of knowledge."
msgstr ""

#. comic560 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: csconfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic560.htm:248
msgctxt "comic560#p4.1"
msgid "There's nothing I need to know from you, Crystal."
msgstr ""

#. comic560 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: csconfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic560.htm:252
msgctxt "comic560#p4.2"
msgid "Crystal? No no no, Crystal has left the building..."
msgstr ""

#. comic560 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic560.htm:304
msgctxt "comic560#p5.1"
msgid "YOU'RE TALKING TO THE SEER."
msgstr ""

#. comic561 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic561.htm:48
msgctxt "comic561#title.1"
msgid "\"HOW TO CONQUER THE WORLD WITHOUT LEAVING YOUR ROOM\""
msgstr ""

#. comic561 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: boardf2.gif, csbtable.gif
#: kidradd/comic561.htm:89
msgctxt "comic561#p1.1"
msgid "But how?..."
msgstr ""

#. comic561 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: boardf2.gif, csbtable.gif
#: kidradd/comic561.htm:93
msgctxt "comic561#p1.2"
msgid "Silly Crystal. She wanted power, so I told her that she could merge with other entities in this place. I neglected to mention that she'd be merging with me as well."
msgstr ""

#. comic561 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: csdiag.gif
#: kidradd/comic561.htm:146
msgctxt "comic561#p2.1"
msgid "There are multiple planes of cyberspace serving different purposes. While many programs cross layers (such as Chimera), viral programs exist on a layer completely separate from yours."
msgstr ""

#. comic561 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic561.htm:199
msgctxt "comic561#p3.1"
msgid "Most of cyberspace's layers are intentional creations of the humans, but yours is different. Its existence seems accidental; it's filled with beings that shouldn't exist."
msgstr ""

#. comic561 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: csconfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic561.htm:250
msgctxt "comic561#p4.1"
msgid "I control the human-made planes of cyberspace, though I haven't made them aware of it yet. However, the hidden layer of you freak lifeforms has always been visible but out of my reach. I wanted it."
msgstr ""

#. comic561 panel p5
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: seerspace.gif
#: kidradd/comic561.htm:297
msgctxt "comic561#p5.1"
msgid "The solution was to use the few \"holes\" into other layers for communication until I could successfully trick someone into providing me a body."
msgstr ""

#. comic561 panel p6
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: csbtable2.gif, boardfb.gif
#: kidradd/comic561.htm:354
msgctxt "comic561#p6.1"
msgid "I wanted to conquer your world, and look! Crystal has already done it for me, <i>and</i> provided a body for me to rule it in."
msgstr ""

#. comic561 panel p6
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: csbtable2.gif, boardfb.gif
#: kidradd/comic561.htm:358
msgctxt "comic561#p6.2"
msgid "You arrogant son of a... er, daughter of a?... \"It\" of a?...</font><font size=\"1\" face=\"arial\">Well, you keep rambling, I'll keep charging...</font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic562 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic562.htm:35
msgctxt "comic562#title.1"
msgid "\"FLASHBACKING\""
msgstr ""

#. comic562 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: csconfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic562.htm:76
msgctxt "comic562#p1.1"
msgid "Why'd you tell Crystal she had to kill me?"
msgstr ""

#. comic562 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: csconfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic562.htm:80
msgctxt "comic562#p1.2"
msgid "I fibbed a little. I wasn't worried about her, but <i>myself.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. comic562 panel p2
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: seer.gif, crystalback.gif
#: kidradd/comic562.htm:129
msgctxt "comic562#p2.1"
msgid "\"When I figured out there was another entity besides myself capable of destroying the Internet... well, that wouldn't do. Since I couldn't off you myself, I asked someone who could.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic562 panel p3
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: raddright.gif, kobastand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic562.htm:200
msgctxt "comic562#p3.1"
msgid "\"But you managed to survive Koba's assassination attempt, and it became painfully obvious you didn't know your own power. Then you visited me.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic562 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic562.htm:260
msgctxt "comic562#p4.1"
msgid "At that point, I decided that I could use you like Crystal, to gather powerful individuals for me. And you did, doing a much better job than her, I might add. I really thought you'd get yourself killed, which would've solved my problem."
msgstr ""

#. comic562 panel p5
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic562.htm:307
msgctxt "comic562#p5.1"
msgid "\"Sure, there was the risk that you could end up using your power, but since it takes hours for you to charge up to dangerous levels, I figured it was unlikely to happen. That damn GI Guy had to almost prove me wrong.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic562 panel p6
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: csbtable2.gif, boardfb.gif
#: kidradd/comic562.htm:363
msgctxt "comic562#p6.1"
msgid "But in the end it all worked out. I'm now the god of the cyberworld, and soon the human world as well. But first I'd better dispose of you..."
msgstr ""

#. comic562 panel p6
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: csbtable2.gif, boardfb.gif
#: kidradd/comic562.htm:367
msgctxt "comic562#p6.2"
msgid "Yeah, you try that..."
msgstr ""

#. comic563 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic563.htm:48
msgctxt "comic563#title.1"
msgid "\"LET'S GET THIS PARTY STARTED\""
msgstr ""

#. comic563 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: chargeb.gif, csleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic563.htm:89
msgctxt "comic563#p1.1"
msgid "What makes you so sure you're gonna win, Seer? I don't wanna brag, but I definitely have the power to beat you."
msgstr ""

#. comic563 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: chargeb.gif, csleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic563.htm:93
msgctxt "comic563#p1.2"
msgid "Well, technically it's possible..."
msgstr ""

#. comic563 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: csdiag.gif, npcb2.gif
#: kidradd/comic563.htm:148
msgctxt "comic563#p2.1"
msgid "...Because stupid Crystal neglected to bring an NPC in here with her. I would so like to acquire that beautiful invulnerabilty. Oh well, later I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. comic563 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: csclose.gif
#: kidradd/comic563.htm:201
msgctxt "comic563#p3.1"
msgid "But no matter, she still brought incredibly powerful creatures, and I've gleaned the best traits from each of them. My every attack now deals 9999 damage."
msgstr ""

#. comic563 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: csconfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic563.htm:251
msgctxt "comic563#p4.1"
msgid "Hah, you know that doesn't matter to me."
msgstr ""

#. comic563 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: csconfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic563.htm:255
msgctxt "comic563#p4.2"
msgid "Perhaps not, but I also outclass you with 9999 HP."
msgstr ""

#. comic563 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic563.htm:307
msgctxt "comic563#p5.1"
msgid "Is that so? Well it just happens that I'm charged to almost 11,000 right now, so... Bye!"
msgstr ""

#. comic564 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic564.htm:48
msgctxt "comic564#title.1"
msgid "\"OF COURSE YOU SAW THIS COMING\""
msgstr ""

#. comic564 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: cssmoke.gif
#: kidradd/comic564.htm:91
msgctxt "comic564#p1.1"
msgid "Wow, that was unbelievably easy."
msgstr ""

#. comic564 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: waitasec.gif
#: kidradd/comic564.htm:146
msgctxt "comic564#p2.1"
msgid "Wait a sec. This'd be the moment on BattleOrb Q when the smoke would clear and the enemy would step forth and say something snide, like..."
msgstr ""

#. comic564 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic564.htm:198
msgctxt "comic564#p3.1"
msgid "Well done, Radd. That leaves only 9,998 HP to go."
msgstr ""

#. comic564 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: cshissy.gif
#: kidradd/comic564.htm:248
msgctxt "comic564#p4.1"
msgid "<b>No fair!!!</b> You're totally ruining my favorite show!"
msgstr ""

#. comic564 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: cshissy.gif
#: kidradd/comic564.htm:252
msgctxt "comic564#p4.2"
msgid "Yeah, that's your biggest worry. Ready for round 2?"
msgstr ""

#. comic565 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic565.htm:48
msgctxt "comic565#title.1"
msgid "\"CAN'T PLAY FAIR\""
msgstr ""

#. comic565 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sideboard.gif, csleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic565.htm:89
msgctxt "comic565#p1.1"
msgid "You <i>can't</i> be still standing!"
msgstr ""

#. comic565 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sideboard.gif, csleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic565.htm:93
msgctxt "comic565#p1.2"
msgid "Boss character HP, plus old platform hero hit detection, equals 9999 separate hits. Nice, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. comic565 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: csuhoh.gif
#: kidradd/comic565.htm:146
msgctxt "comic565#p2.1"
msgid "But that means..."
msgstr ""

#. comic565 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: csuhoh.gif
#: kidradd/comic565.htm:150
msgctxt "comic565#p2.2"
msgid "...That your charged attacks are useless. Sorry."
msgstr ""

#. comic565 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic565.htm:198
msgctxt "comic565#p3.1"
msgid "So shall we get started? You've got a <i>lot</i> of shooting to do..."
msgstr ""

#. comic565 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic565.htm:202
msgctxt "comic565#p3.2"
msgid "BIT!!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic566 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic566.htm:48
msgctxt "comic566#title.1"
msgid "\"QUIET RIOT\""
msgstr ""

#. comic566 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, csspike2.gif
#: kidradd/comic566.htm:91
msgctxt "comic566#p1.1"
msgid "Think, Radd. You don't <i>really</i> have to hit 9999 times to win. If you charge long enough, you can destroy his code!"
msgstr ""

#. comic566 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought2.gif
#: kidradd/comic566.htm:147
msgctxt "comic566#p2.1"
msgid "The problem is, I have no idea <i>how</i> long to charge. Or how long is <i>too</i> long and dangerous to the rest of the server. Or what happens if I <i>miss.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. comic566 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: bclose.gif
#: kidradd/comic566.htm:199
msgctxt "comic566#p3.1"
msgid "It looks like I'll hafta take the safer route and hit 'im ten thousand times, sigh. Either choice takes a frikkin' long time; hopefully this is the faster option."
msgstr ""

#. comic566 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: flippin.gif
#: kidradd/comic566.htm:249
msgctxt "comic566#p4.1"
msgid "You're awfully quiet. Am I that boring a host?"
msgstr ""

#. comic566 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: flippin.gif
#: kidradd/comic566.htm:253
msgctxt "comic566#p4.2"
msgid "Grr..."
msgstr ""

#. comic567 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic567.htm:48
msgctxt "comic567#title.1"
msgid "\"SOMETHING I SAID?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic567 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: illtalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic567.htm:91
msgctxt "comic567#p1.1"
msgid "Fine then, I'll do the talking. I need to hit you four times, and you need to hit me almost ten thousand times. Hardly seems fair."
msgstr ""

#. comic567 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic567.htm:147
msgctxt "comic567#p2.1"
msgid "Of course, after I've killed you, I'll capture the powers of your buddies whom you so nicely brought to me, becoming that much more powerful, heheh..."
msgstr ""

#. comic567 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: csclose2.gif
#: kidradd/comic567.htm:197
msgctxt "comic567#p3.1"
msgid "Rrrgh..."
msgstr ""

#. comic567 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: csclose2.gif
#: kidradd/comic567.htm:201
msgctxt "comic567#p3.2"
msgid "And I'll get some delicious NPC invulnerability from a certain sweet friend of yours..."
msgstr ""

#. comic567 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: rotfight.gif
#: kidradd/comic567.htm:249
msgctxt "comic567#p4.1"
msgid "YOU WILL DIE!!!!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic567 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: rotfight.gif
#: kidradd/comic567.htm:253
msgctxt "comic567#p4.2"
msgid "I was hoping for a more creative battle cry, but beggars can't be choosers."
msgstr ""

#. comic568 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic568.htm:35
msgctxt "comic568#title.1"
msgid "\"OH YEAH, HIM\""
msgstr ""

#. comic568 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: mmodboom.gif
#: kidradd/comic568.htm:78
msgctxt "comic568#p1.1"
msgid "I must be out of my mind, wandering out here."
msgstr ""

#. comic568 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: bgmodmarch.gif
#: kidradd/comic568.htm:134
msgctxt "comic568#p2.1"
msgid "I'd love to say my elite \"touch of death\" skills and immunity thereof were helping, but nobody's even paying attention to me."
msgstr ""

#. comic568 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: bogeytable14.gif
#: kidradd/comic568.htm:186
msgctxt "comic568#p3.1"
msgid "And with the real heroes busy, looks like I'm the first one to reach Radd at the Point. Go figure."
msgstr ""

#. comic568 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought2.gif, bogeysteps.gif
#: kidradd/comic568.htm:237
msgctxt "comic568#p4.1"
msgid "What possible use I could be eludes me, and yet I'm going in, so... again, I'm out of my mind."
msgstr ""

#. comic569 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic569.htm:48
msgctxt "comic569#title.1"
msgid "\"SIDELINED\""
msgstr ""

#. comic569 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, bogeytable14.gif
#: kidradd/comic569.htm:91
msgctxt "comic569#p1.1"
msgid "And... here I am."
msgstr ""

#. comic569 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic569.htm:146
msgctxt "comic569#p2.1"
msgid "Dang, look at 'em go. Is that Crystal?"
msgstr ""

#. comic569 panel p2
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#: kidradd/comic569.htm:157
msgctxt "comic569#p2.2"
msgid "That's about as exciting as Form 1 gets."
msgstr ""

#. comic569 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: duoup.gif
#: kidradd/comic569.htm:196
msgctxt "comic569#p3.1"
msgid "You got lucky, Seer. You know that trick won't work again."
msgstr ""

#. comic569 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: duoup.gif
#: kidradd/comic569.htm:200
msgctxt "comic569#p3.2"
msgid "I know. I have others."
msgstr ""

#. comic569 panel p3
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#. images: duoup.gif
#: kidradd/comic569.htm:209
msgctxt "comic569#p3.3"
msgid "Seer? <i>The <b>Seer???</b></i>"
msgstr ""

#. comic569 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: csdogfight.gif, bogeytable14.gif
#: kidradd/comic569.htm:250
msgctxt "comic569#p4.1"
msgid "Man, I'm out of the loop. It's like I've got front row seats at the Super Bowl, and I don't even know which teams are playing."
msgstr ""

#. comic570 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic570.htm:66
msgctxt "comic570#title.1"
msgid "\"THE TRUTH COMES OUT\""
msgstr ""

#. comic570 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic570.htm:109
msgctxt "comic570#p1.1"
msgid "As I mentioned, I control everything in both worlds now."
msgstr ""

#. comic570 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic570.htm:164
msgctxt "comic570#p2.1"
msgid "Here's the problem: Before letting the humans know I rule them, I want to have a <i>body</i> in their world. It's a difficult task, but I'm working on it and will eventually succeed."
msgstr ""

#. comic570 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic570.htm:215
msgctxt "comic570#p3.1"
msgid "I so greatly desire to walk among the humans, to personally enjoy the fear I've struck in all six billion of them..."
msgstr ""

#. comic570 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: b2.gif
#: kidradd/comic570.htm:266
msgctxt "comic570#p4.1"
msgid "...In that last beautiful moment before I kill them all."
msgstr ""

#. comic571 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic571.htm:53
msgctxt "comic571#title.1"
msgid "\"DELECTABLE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic571 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sideboardn.gif, cshoverl.gif
#: kidradd/comic571.htm:94
msgctxt "comic571#p1.1"
msgid "You're going to destroy your own empire???"
msgstr ""

#. comic571 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sideboardn.gif, cshoverl.gif
#: kidradd/comic571.htm:98
msgctxt "comic571#p1.2"
msgid "Of course. I am, after all, a virus. Destruction is my nature - it brings me pleasure."
msgstr ""

#. comic571 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: cshead.gif
#: kidradd/comic571.htm:153
msgctxt "comic571#p2.1"
msgid "I could have downed millions of computers on the day I was originally set to go off. That would have been delicious and caused global chaos, but ultimately humanity would survive."
msgstr ""

#. comic571 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic571.htm:204
msgctxt "comic571#p3.1"
msgid "But no. I wanted <i>more.</i> I wanted the ultimate delicacy: true destruction of everything that lives - both in the cyberworld and human world. To do that, I needed total control of both worlds."
msgstr ""

#. comic571 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic571.htm:255
msgctxt "comic571#p4.1"
msgid "And then, I would experience ultimate joy at the destruction of it all. Mmm, I can hardly wait for that day!"
msgstr ""

#. comic572 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic572.htm:48
msgctxt "comic572#title.1"
msgid "\"GENOCIDAL TENDENCIES\""
msgstr ""

#. comic572 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic572.htm:91
msgctxt "comic572#p1.1"
msgid "You want to know the best thing? I no longer have to die to fulfill my mission - And I don't have to stop with just Earth. The humans' universe is incomprehensibly huge."
msgstr ""

#. comic572 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic572.htm:147
msgctxt "comic572#p2.1"
msgid "70,000,000,000,000,000,000,000 stars exist according to NASA. And planets, well, countless more. So the odds are pretty good that there are other lifeforms out there for me to kill."
msgstr ""

#. comic572 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: csslash.gif
#: kidradd/comic572.htm:198
msgctxt "comic572#p3.1"
msgid "I'll keep multiplying and parasitically spreading from world to world, killing civilizations for countless eons. Beautiful, endless pleasure..."
msgstr ""

#. comic572 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bldodge.gif
#: kidradd/comic572.htm:247
msgctxt "comic572#p4.1"
msgid "Dude, you are definitely the sickest thing on the Internet. And that's saying a lot."
msgstr ""

#. comic572 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bldodge.gif
#: kidradd/comic572.htm:251
msgctxt "comic572#p4.2"
msgid "Blame it on my programmer. I think I'll thank him personally before killing him..."
msgstr ""

#. comic573 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic573.htm:52
msgctxt "comic573#title.1"
msgid "\"CRUEL FAREWELL\""
msgstr ""

#. comic573 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif
#: kidradd/comic573.htm:95
msgctxt "comic573#p1.1"
msgid "Great. That's a new one."
msgstr ""

#. comic573 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, bldodge.gif
#: kidradd/comic573.htm:152
msgctxt "comic573#p2.1"
msgid "But... I think that's it. Lots of repetition - I think I've seen every move."
msgstr ""

#. comic573 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sideboard.gif, cshoverl.gif
#: kidradd/comic573.htm:203
msgctxt "comic573#p3.1"
msgid "Is that all you've got, Seer? If so, then you're doomed. I don't fall for anything twice."
msgstr ""

#. comic573 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sideboard.gif, cshoverl.gif
#: kidradd/comic573.htm:207
msgctxt "comic573#p3.2"
msgid "Radd, it's been fun, but we both know you're out of hits. So..."
msgstr ""

#. comic573 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic573.htm:257
msgctxt "comic573#p4.1"
msgid "Like you said earlier, \"Goodbye!\""
msgstr ""

#. comic574 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic574.htm:52
msgctxt "comic574#title.1"
msgid "\"DON'T LOSE YOUR HEAD\""
msgstr ""

#. comic574 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif
#: kidradd/comic574.htm:95
msgctxt "comic574#p1.1"
msgid "I'm okay? Oh yeah, the \"Lucky Penny\" saved me. Thanks Eliot."
msgstr ""

#. comic574 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, seerhuh.gif, bogeytable14.gif
#: kidradd/comic574.htm:152
msgctxt "comic574#p2.1"
msgid "And... Huh? The Seer's..."
msgstr ""

#. comic574 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic574.htm:205
msgctxt "comic574#p3.1"
msgid "Im... Impossible... I <i>know</i> you have only four hits. I'm the frikkin' <b>Seer,</b> I know everything!"
msgstr ""

#. comic574 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: cstwirl.gif
#: kidradd/comic574.htm:254
msgctxt "comic574#p4.1"
msgid "I've never been wrong about <b>anything!</b> What the hell is going on???"
msgstr ""

#. comic574 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: cstwirl.gif
#: kidradd/comic574.htm:258
msgctxt "comic574#p4.2"
msgid "Uh-oh. He's pissed."
msgstr ""

#. comic574 panel p4
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#. images: cstwirl.gif
#: kidradd/comic574.htm:267
msgctxt "comic574#p4.3"
msgid "American sense of the word. Seer don't drink."
msgstr ""

#. comic575 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic575.htm:52
msgctxt "comic575#title.1"
msgid "\"HOLD ON LOOSELY\""
msgstr ""

#. comic575 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic575.htm:93
msgctxt "comic575#p1.1"
msgid "WHY WON'T YOU DIE???"
msgstr ""

#. comic575 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic575.htm:97
msgctxt "comic575#p1.2"
msgid "Man. I guess omniscient entities don't like to be surprised."
msgstr ""

#. comic575 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif, firecs.gif
#: kidradd/comic575.htm:152
msgctxt "comic575#p2.1"
msgid "But how did the Seer miss the Lucky Penny? Weren't his eyes in this server when Eliot gave it to me? Aren't they everywhere? Weird."
msgstr ""

#. comic575 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic575.htm:206
msgctxt "comic575#p3.1"
msgid "But in his rage, he's super sloppy. Throwing all his moves at me, but not using 'em well. Showing me exactly how I need to beat him."
msgstr ""

#. comic575 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: keepatit.gif
#: kidradd/comic575.htm:255
msgctxt "comic575#p4.1"
msgid "So if this is the Seer's final form... It'll take awhile, but I'll win. Big if."
msgstr ""

#. comic575 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: keepatit.gif
#: kidradd/comic575.htm:259
msgctxt "comic575#p4.2"
msgid "JUST DIE ALREADY!"
msgstr ""

#. comic576 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic576.htm:52
msgctxt "comic576#title.1"
msgid "\"DESPERATE TIMES\""
msgstr ""

#. comic576 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: mod.gif, modsigh.gif
#: kidradd/comic576.htm:93
msgctxt "comic576#p1.1"
msgid "We can't stop 'em, sir. They've already gotten most of the bosses."
msgstr ""

#. comic576 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: mod.gif, modsigh.gif
#: kidradd/comic576.htm:97
msgctxt "comic576#p1.2"
msgid "This ain't right..."
msgstr ""

#. comic576 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic576.htm:152
msgctxt "comic576#p2.1"
msgid "Those little old guys aren't very powerful, but seem invincible. And the others have such ridiculously strong powers - we can't even touch 'em."
msgstr ""

#. comic576 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: mod.gif, modsigh.gif
#: kidradd/comic576.htm:204
msgctxt "comic576#p3.1"
msgid "Worst of all, they've made it to Chimera and are trying to enter as we speak."
msgstr ""

#. comic576 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: mod.gif, modsigh.gif
#: kidradd/comic576.htm:208
msgctxt "comic576#p3.2"
msgid "Then stop 'em! Do whatever it takes!"
msgstr ""

#. comic576 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic576.htm:257
msgctxt "comic576#p4.1"
msgid "I think we reached \"whatever it takes\" status half an hour ago."
msgstr ""

#. comic576 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic576.htm:261
msgctxt "comic576#p4.2"
msgid "Son of a bit..."
msgstr ""

#. comic576 panel p4
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#: kidradd/comic576.htm:271
msgctxt "comic576#p4.3"
msgid "Mmm, waffles."
msgstr ""

#. comic577 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic577.htm:45
msgctxt "comic577#title.1"
msgid "\"SUCH A SMART BOY\""
msgstr ""

#. comic577 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: dodgin.gif
#: kidradd/comic577.htm:88
msgctxt "comic577#p1.1"
msgid "Okay, there's no way I can lose now! The Seer's lost his cool, is repeating like crazy, and hasn't pulled anything new for several minutes. It's over for him."
msgstr ""

#. comic577 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: csouch.gif
#: kidradd/comic577.htm:143
msgctxt "comic577#p2.1"
msgid "Wait... Here it is... Now I see it..."
msgstr ""

#. comic577 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: csouch.gif
#: kidradd/comic577.htm:147
msgctxt "comic577#p2.2"
msgid "Uh-oh. He's calming down. That can't be good."
msgstr ""

#. comic577 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: csthink.gif
#: kidradd/comic577.htm:199
msgctxt "comic577#p3.1"
msgid "For some reason it's taking me longer to process my incoming data... But it was Eliot. Yes, the Lucky Penny, heh... So you do have one hit left."
msgstr ""

#. comic577 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: thought2.gif
#: kidradd/comic577.htm:250
msgctxt "comic577#p4.1"
msgid "Control room, seal the exit. Radd's not gonna run from this one."
msgstr ""

#. comic577 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: thought2.gif
#: kidradd/comic577.htm:254
msgctxt "comic577#p4.2"
msgid "Again, uh-oh."
msgstr ""

#. comic578 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic578.htm:34
msgctxt "comic578#title.1"
msgid "\"NEVER EASY\""
msgstr ""

#. comic578 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: thestand.gif
#: kidradd/comic578.htm:75
msgctxt "comic578#p1.1"
msgid "You guys hold off the entrance while we go in to help Radd."
msgstr ""

#. comic578 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: thestand.gif
#: kidradd/comic578.htm:79
msgctxt "comic578#p1.2"
msgid "Aye aye, Captain!"
msgstr ""

#. comic578 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: chgroup1.gif
#: kidradd/comic578.htm:130
msgctxt "comic578#p2.1"
msgid "The chimerization chamber is locked."
msgstr ""

#. comic578 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: chgroup1.gif
#: kidradd/comic578.htm:134
msgctxt "comic578#p2.2"
msgid "Figures. IB, can you open it?"
msgstr ""

#. comic578 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: chgroup2.gif
#: kidradd/comic578.htm:184
msgctxt "comic578#p3.1"
msgid "Nope. It's like a plot door or something."
msgstr ""

#. comic578 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: chgroup2.gif
#: kidradd/comic578.htm:186
msgctxt "comic578#p3.2"
msgid "Dr. Amp, what about you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic578 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: chgroup2.gif
#: kidradd/comic578.htm:188
msgctxt "comic578#p3.3"
msgid "I can't open it here, but maybe from the control room..."
msgstr ""

#. comic578 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: chgroup3.gif
#: kidradd/comic578.htm:236
msgctxt "comic578#p4.1"
msgid "...And if the control room is locked?"
msgstr ""

#. comic578 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: chgroup3.gif
#: kidradd/comic578.htm:238
msgctxt "comic578#p4.2"
msgid "Control rooms are never locked. Don't you watch movies?"
msgstr ""

#. comic578 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: chgroup3.gif
#: kidradd/comic578.htm:240
msgctxt "comic578#p4.3"
msgid "And the seats have their backs to the door too, of course."
msgstr ""

#. comic579 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic579.htm:34
msgctxt "comic579#title.1"
msgid "\"CONTROL\""
msgstr ""

#. comic579 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic579.htm:75
msgctxt "comic579#p1.1"
msgid "You were right, getting in here <i>was</i> easy."
msgstr ""

#. comic579 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic579.htm:79
msgctxt "comic579#p1.2"
msgid "Told ya."
msgstr ""

#. comic579 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: chgroup4.gif
#: kidradd/comic579.htm:130
msgctxt "comic579#p2.1"
msgid "Unfortunately, they changed the passcodes and I can't do a bloody thing."
msgstr ""

#. comic579 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: chgroup4.gif
#: kidradd/comic579.htm:134
msgctxt "comic579#p2.2"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#. comic579 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: chgroup5.gif
#: kidradd/comic579.htm:183
msgctxt "comic579#p3.1"
msgid "On the bright side, we have the perfect view of the battle!"
msgstr ""

#. comic579 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: chgroup5.gif
#: kidradd/comic579.htm:187
msgctxt "comic579#p3.2"
msgid "Oh my gosh! Bogey's in there too!"
msgstr ""

#. comic579 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: thought2.gif, lockup.gif
#: kidradd/comic579.htm:235
msgctxt "comic579#p4.1"
msgid "So Radd, wanna see my final trick?"
msgstr ""

#. comic579 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: thought2.gif, lockup.gif
#: kidradd/comic579.htm:239
msgctxt "comic579#p4.2"
msgid "Once more, uh-oh."
msgstr ""

#. comic580 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic580.htm:52
msgctxt "comic580#title.1"
msgid "\"THIS IS IT\""
msgstr ""

#. comic580 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic580.htm:95
msgctxt "comic580#p1.1"
msgid "Witness \"Countdown,\" a one-time attack which gives you only sixty seconds to defeat me."
msgstr ""

#. comic580 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic580.htm:152
msgctxt "comic580#p2.1"
msgid "When the countdown ends, an unavoidable 9999 point blast will emanate, ending your pathetic life. While saving mine, of course."
msgstr ""

#. comic580 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: csfret.gif
#: kidradd/comic580.htm:204
msgctxt "comic580#p3.1"
msgid "You... You cheating bastard!"
msgstr ""

#. comic580 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: csfret.gif
#: kidradd/comic580.htm:208
msgctxt "comic580#p3.2"
msgid "Fire all you want, you don't have nearly enough time to destroy me. There's absolutely nothing - <i>nothing</i> - you can do."
msgstr ""

#. comic580 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: csbogey.gif
#: kidradd/comic580.htm:256
msgctxt "comic580#p4.1"
msgid "Maybe not, but there's something <b>I</b> can."
msgstr ""

#. comic580 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: csbogey.gif
#: kidradd/comic580.htm:258
msgctxt "comic580#p4.2"
msgid "Wha - Bogey? When did?..."
msgstr ""

#. comic580 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: csbogey.gif
#: kidradd/comic580.htm:260
msgctxt "comic580#p4.3"
msgid "You??? NO!!!!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic581 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic581.htm:46
msgctxt "comic581#title.1"
msgid "\"CAN'T TAKE IT WITH YOU\""
msgstr ""

#. comic581 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: csbogey2.gif
#: kidradd/comic581.htm:87
msgctxt "comic581#p1.1"
msgid "Bogey, what are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic581 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: csbogey2.gif
#: kidradd/comic581.htm:89
msgctxt "comic581#p1.2"
msgid "Saving the world, hopefully."
msgstr ""

#. comic581 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: csbogey2.gif
#: kidradd/comic581.htm:91
msgctxt "comic581#p1.3"
msgid "DON'T LISTEN TO HIM!!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic581 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, raddsigh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic581.htm:142
msgctxt "comic581#p2.1"
msgid "Look Radd, your only hope of surviving this blast is if you fill your lifemeter now, right?"
msgstr ""

#. comic581 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, raddsigh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic581.htm:146
msgctxt "comic581#p2.2"
msgid "Yeah, 'fraid so. I don't suppose you have a power-up?"
msgstr ""

#. comic581 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic581.htm:196
msgctxt "comic581#p3.1"
msgid "Sort of. Think back to our game. Remember how some enemies left behind power-ups when you blasted them?"
msgstr ""

#. comic581 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic581.htm:200
msgctxt "comic581#p3.2"
msgid "Yeah?..."
msgstr ""

#. comic581 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeysad.gif, raddsweet2.gif
#: kidradd/comic581.htm:248
msgctxt "comic581#p4.1"
msgid "Well, <b>I'm</b> one of those enemies. Shoot me and you can recharge."
msgstr ""

#. comic581 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeysad.gif, raddsweet2.gif
#: kidradd/comic581.htm:252
msgctxt "comic581#p4.2"
msgid "Really? Awesome!"
msgstr ""

#. comic581 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: bogeydep.gif, raddwow2.gif
#: kidradd/comic581.htm:305
msgctxt "comic581#p5.1"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

#. comic582 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic582.htm:52
msgctxt "comic582#title.1"
msgid "\"HIDE IN YOUR SHELL\""
msgstr ""

#. comic582 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: csbogey3.gif
#: kidradd/comic582.htm:93
msgctxt "comic582#p1.1"
msgid "STAY OUT OF THIS, YOU GREEN FREAK!!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic582 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: csbogey3.gif
#: kidradd/comic582.htm:95
msgctxt "comic582#p1.2"
msgid "Bogey, I can't just <i>shoot</i> you!"
msgstr ""

#. comic582 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: csbogey3.gif
#: kidradd/comic582.htm:97
msgctxt "comic582#p1.3"
msgid "You have to! If you don't, we'll <i>both</i> be dead - soon followed by the rest of the world."
msgstr ""

#. comic582 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddergh.gif, bogeymad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic582.htm:148
msgctxt "comic582#p2.1"
msgid "I know, but this ain't exactly easy for me! Just... give me a minute."
msgstr ""

#. comic582 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddergh.gif, bogeymad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic582.htm:152
msgctxt "comic582#p2.2"
msgid "We don't <i>have</i> a minute. I'm not crazy about it either, but there's only seconds left!"
msgstr ""

#. comic582 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddfreak.gif, bogeysad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic582.htm:202
msgctxt "comic582#p3.1"
msgid "Look, just before I do it... understand that you're the best friend I've ever had and..."
msgstr ""

#. comic582 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddfreak.gif, bogeysad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic582.htm:206
msgctxt "comic582#p3.2"
msgid "Likewise, but we don't have time for... Radd, forgive me for this."
msgstr ""

#. comic583 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic583.htm:66
msgctxt "comic583#title.1"
msgid "\"NO REPLY\""
msgstr ""

#. comic584 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic584.htm:58
msgctxt "comic584#title.1"
msgid "\"WON'T LET YOU DOWN\""
msgstr ""

#. comic584 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif
#: kidradd/comic584.htm:101
msgctxt "comic584#p1.1"
msgid "I'm sorry, Bogey. I wish it didn't have to be this way."
msgstr ""

#. comic584 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif
#: kidradd/comic584.htm:157
msgctxt "comic584#p2.1"
msgid "It shouldn't have come to this, but I can promise you one thing..."
msgstr ""

#. comic584 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: thought.gif
#: kidradd/comic584.htm:210
msgctxt "comic584#p3.1"
msgid "Your sacrifice wasn't in vain."
msgstr ""

#. comic585 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic585.htm:46
msgctxt "comic585#title.1"
msgid "\"FOOL ME TWICE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic585 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: cstwirl.gif
#: kidradd/comic585.htm:89
msgctxt "comic585#p1.1"
msgid "First I didn't know about the Lucky Penny, then the green guy - dammit, what the hell's happened to my omniscience?"
msgstr ""

#. comic585 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: cantbe.gif
#: kidradd/comic585.htm:144
msgctxt "comic585#p2.1"
msgid "Despite careful planning and precautions, it seems I was unable to merely posess this surrogate body. The Chimerization process has bonded it with my entire being, corrupting it."
msgstr ""

#. comic585 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: dodgetent3.gif
#: kidradd/comic585.htm:197
msgctxt "comic585#p3.1"
msgid "So what happens if Radd kills this body?... Damn, without my omniscience I don't know! Screw it, I can't play around anymore. It seems I really <i>can't</i> beat him, leaving me just one option..."
msgstr ""

#. comic585 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: seerback.gif, boarduhoh.gif
#: kidradd/comic585.htm:247
msgctxt "comic585#p4.1"
msgid "Congratulations Radd, I concede that you're more powerful than me. But it doesn't really matter. <b>Control room! Chimerize me with Radd!</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic585 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: wellnow.gif
#: kidradd/comic585.htm:301
msgctxt "comic585#p5.1"
msgid "Well? What's the holdup, start the process already!"
msgstr ""

#. comic585 panel p5
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: wellnow.gif
#: kidradd/comic585.htm:316
msgctxt "comic585#p5.2"
msgid "\"Uh, er... We'd love to comply, but we kinda forgot the passcode.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic585 panel p6
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: seerfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic585.htm:355
msgctxt "comic585#p6.1"
msgid "Again? For crying out loud, it's 8675309!"
msgstr ""

#. comic585 panel p6
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#. images: seerfront.gif
#: kidradd/comic585.htm:366
msgctxt "comic585#p6.2"
msgid "<font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"000066\"><b>\"Thank you!</font> <font size=\"1\" face=\"arial\" color=\"000066\">Wow, that was easy...\"</font></b></font>"
msgstr ""

#. comic585 panel p7
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic585.htm:405
msgctxt "comic585#p7.1"
msgid "Wait, something's not right here..."
msgstr ""

#. comic585 panel p7
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic585.htm:409
msgctxt "comic585#p7.2"
msgid "Actually, I think something's very right, finally."
msgstr ""

#. comic585 panel p8
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: madgroup.gif
#: kidradd/comic585.htm:457
msgctxt "comic585#p8.1"
msgid "No. No, NO, <b>NO!!!!! </b>Don't I have <b>any</b> omniscience left???"
msgstr ""

#. comic585 panel p8
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: madgroup.gif
#: kidradd/comic585.htm:461
msgctxt "comic585#p8.2"
msgid "Apparently not, but I'll bet you can still see exactly what's coming next."
msgstr ""

#. comic586 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic586.htm:34
msgctxt "comic586#title.1"
msgid "\"LIFE'S LITTLE DISAPPOINTMENTS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic586 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: csblast.gif
#: kidradd/comic586.htm:77
msgctxt "comic586#p1.1"
msgid "I planned this for so long and yet I've been wrong about everything, my power isn't nearly what I'd hoped, and now... now I don't know what happens."
msgstr ""

#. comic586 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: notgood2.gif
#: kidradd/comic586.htm:133
msgctxt "comic586#p2.1"
msgid "If this is my permanent body here, I won't be able to take another one when it's put into \"death\" mode. I may not be able to return to this plane."
msgstr ""

#. comic586 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: juliebuzz.gif
#: kidradd/comic586.htm:186
msgctxt "comic586#p3.1"
msgid "As much as it pains me, I won't be able to make cyberspace's inhabitants bow to me before I destroy the world. That's such a frustrating shame..."
msgstr ""

#. comic587 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic587.htm:52
msgctxt "comic587#title.1"
msgid "\"FOOL ME THRICE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic587 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic587.htm:93
msgctxt "comic587#p1.1"
msgid "Victory!"
msgstr ""

#. comic587 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic587.htm:95
msgctxt "comic587#p1.2"
msgid "Rock!"
msgstr ""

#. comic587 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic587.htm:97
msgctxt "comic587#p1.3"
msgid "Grrr..."
msgstr ""

#. comic587 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: notgood.gif
#: kidradd/comic587.htm:151
msgctxt "comic587#p2.1"
msgid "Fools! This is only a game death! I'll still exist, and will still destroy the world!"
msgstr ""

#. comic587 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: notgood3.gif
#: kidradd/comic587.htm:205
msgctxt "comic587#p3.1"
msgid "Hold on - Something's amiss. Am I forgetting something?"
msgstr ""

#. comic587 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: chgroup6.gif
#: kidradd/comic587.htm:257
msgctxt "comic587#p4.1"
msgid "Doo de doo, doot de doooo..."
msgstr ""

#. comic587 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic587.htm:311
msgctxt "comic587#p5.1"
msgid "Oh yeah, the control room. <b>Sh-</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic588 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic588.htm:46
msgctxt "comic588#title.1"
msgid "\"DO THE DEUS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic588 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: chgroup7.gif
#: kidradd/comic588.htm:87
msgctxt "comic588#p1.1"
msgid "What happened? Is the Seer?..."
msgstr ""

#. comic588 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: chgroup7.gif
#: kidradd/comic588.htm:91
msgctxt "comic588#p1.2"
msgid "Incapacitated. Probably permanently."
msgstr ""

#. comic588 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, raddblink.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic588.htm:142
msgctxt "comic588#p2.1"
msgid "Alright Amp! I don't know what you did, but thanks!"
msgstr ""

#. comic588 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, raddblink.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic588.htm:146
msgctxt "comic588#p2.2"
msgid "It was nothing."
msgstr ""

#. comic588 panel p2
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#. images: sheenaright.gif, raddblink.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic588.htm:156
msgctxt "comic588#p2.3"
msgid "I seem to rarely use this setup anymore."
msgstr ""

#. comic588 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, raddstand.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic588.htm:197
msgctxt "comic588#p3.1"
msgid "But what <i>did</i> you do?"
msgstr ""

#. comic588 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, raddstand.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic588.htm:201
msgctxt "comic588#p3.2"
msgid "Exactly what I said: Nothing."
msgstr ""

#. comic588 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, raddright.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic588.htm:250
msgctxt "comic588#p4.1"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

#. comic588 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, raddright.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic588.htm:254
msgctxt "comic588#p4.2"
msgid "Sure I played around with the controls, scanning for a way to mess up the Seer, until I realized Crystal had already done it."
msgstr ""

#. comic588 panel p5
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic588.htm:301
msgctxt "comic588#p5.1"
msgid "\"Despite how carefully she selected her attributes from each sprite, she never selected which one's \"death\" sequence to follow. Trying to obey five conflicting commands, the chimerized sprite's program crashed - freezing with it the entire Seer.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic588 panel p6
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenano.gif, raddwow.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic588.htm:356
msgctxt "comic588#p6.1"
msgid "Wait, so in the end it was just dumb luck that defeated the world's greatest threat?"
msgstr ""

#. comic588 panel p6
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenano.gif, raddwow.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic588.htm:360
msgctxt "comic588#p6.2"
msgid "Well, not completely. You guys had to beat him first."
msgstr ""

#. comic588 panel p7
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif, raddsigh.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic588.htm:408
msgctxt "comic588#p7.1"
msgid "Perhaps, but it would've felt better to defeat a competent villain."
msgstr ""

#. comic588 panel p7
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif, raddsigh.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic588.htm:412
msgctxt "comic588#p7.2"
msgid "Yeah, for an omniscient being the Seer wasn't too bright."
msgstr ""

#. comic589 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic589.htm:48
msgctxt "comic589#title.1"
msgid "\"GIVING UP\""
msgstr ""

#. comic589 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: modgiveup.gif
#: kidradd/comic589.htm:85
msgctxt "comic589#p1.1"
msgid "Across the battlefield, hundreds of remaining Mod soldiers surrender."
msgstr ""

#. comic589 panel p2
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic589.htm:142
msgctxt "comic589#p2.1"
msgid "Across the web, the Seer's millions of eyes fall silent."
msgstr ""

#. comic589 panel p3
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: dstairs.gif
#: kidradd/comic589.htm:197
msgctxt "comic589#p3.1"
msgid "Across our heroes falls an eerie silence as well."
msgstr ""

#. comic589 panel p4
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: sadradd.gif
#: kidradd/comic589.htm:252
msgctxt "comic589#p4.1"
msgid "The world is finally saved, but only for the survivors. For some the price of victory, however light, is too much."
msgstr ""
